none of them actually believe that Donald Trump&nbsp;
won the 2020 20 election. It's not a surprising&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.080
admission, but I would make the point that it's&nbsp;
actually worse that despite not believing it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

