chair. Republican said no. Whole bunch of reasons&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:14.480
why they said no, many of them bogus. We've talked&nbsp;
about it before. So eventually we get to this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:20.480
House select committee, which is investigating.&nbsp;
And in this one, House Minority Leader Kevin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.040
McCarthy said, here's five Republicans reporting&nbsp;
on it. Two of them were Jim Jordan and Jim Banks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

