They have no business investigating them. And so&nbsp;
Nancy Pelosi, the speaker of the House, rightly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:41.920
said they can't be on the commission ultimately.&nbsp;
We saw Republican Adam Kinzinger and Republican&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:50.560
Liz Cheney placed onto this panel and on after&nbsp;
the first day during which we heard from four&nbsp;&nbsp;

