officials don't believe Trump really. One, this is&nbsp;
not about Republican voters. That's an important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:14.160
distinction, which we're going to talk about in&nbsp;
a second. But let's start with the interview here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:18.400
and very, very important points made.
Speaker 3: We can get the answers. If&nbsp;&nbsp;

